  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/655/655-82.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:82 Uncontested Primary. –\n\nIn the event that no party has more than one candidate file and no nonparty or other candidate files a declaration of intent, the primary election shall not be conducted. In such a case, the special election shall be held on the day previously fixed as the day for the holding of the special primary election."
